<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="S5.F7.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S5.F7.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results for Relative Pose Estimation (top) Multi-View Reconstruction (bottom).</span>
Multi-view reconstruction performance seems to be robust against sparsification of global attention; even in the highest sparsity settings, the results are on par or better than other state-of-the-art methods.
We provide comprehensive tables for these results in the supplementary material.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
